scenario no_overpay over forecast
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-26
  note "B-12's asks sit here, since they read the forecast's items (L §6.4: only inside that scenario and the scenarios over it). B-12 · 2026 to 2028 (questions.md): as of 2028-12-31, known as of 2026-01-02. B-HR3 runs the story's forecast with B-HR2 v2's overpayments (the scenario forecast) and with nothing overpaid (the scenario no_overpay), on the same paths (L §5.16: one address, one sample in every world). Whether more than one path in five goes below the line is read from the printed shares: Tally prints no verdict over paths, and a share can't feed a rule."
  note "B-HR3: nothing overpaid from 2026-01-26 to the end of 2028; all of the 26th rule's surplus goes to savings. The world B-HR3 compares with the scenario forecast (B-HR2 v2's overpayments), and the world it decides on when the overpayments stop."

version hr3_stop
  cite house_rules
  governs 2026-01-26..
  known 2026-01-02
  replace hr2_cap = 0.00 DUK governs 2026-01-26.. "B-HR3: we stop overpaying from 2026-01-26 to the end of 2028"

ask b12_share: share(liquid_low < hr3_line) in forecast law 2027-01-31 as known 2026-01-02 with uncertain paths 3 seed 20260102

ask b12_share_without: share(liquid_low < hr3_line) in no_overpay law 2027-01-31 as known 2026-01-02 with uncertain paths 3 seed 20260102

ask b12_shortfall: mean(max(0 DUK, hr3_line - liquid_low)) in forecast law 2027-01-31 as known 2026-01-02 with uncertain paths 3 seed 20260102

ask b12_shortfall_without: mean(max(0 DUK, hr3_line - liquid_low)) in no_overpay law 2027-01-31 as known 2026-01-02 with uncertain paths 3 seed 20260102

ask b12_mortgage: mean(mtg_bal[2027-01-31]) in no_overpay law 2027-01-31 as known 2026-01-02 paths 3 seed 20260102

ask b12_tax: mean(sum(tax_flat[m] for m in months where year_of(m) >= 2026)) in no_overpay law 2027-01-31 as known 2026-01-02 with uncertain paths 30 seed 20260102

ask b12_liquid: mean(bal(cis, 2027-01-31) + bal(savings, 2027-01-31)) in no_overpay law 2027-01-31 as known 2026-01-02 windows each with uncertain paths 1 seed 20260102

ask b12_zero_tax: mean(sum(tax_flat[m] for m in months where year_of(m) >= 2026)) in no_overpay with sample fc_arnika_delay[*] = 25, sample fc_nproj[*] = 0, sample fc_law = 0 law 2027-01-31 as known 2026-01-02 paths 1 seed 20260102

ask b12_mortgage_q07: mean(mtg_bal[2027-01-31]) in no_overpay law 2027-01-31 as known 2026-01-07 paths 3 seed 20260102

ask o3_jan: avg_wage_q4 in forecast law 2026-01-15 as known 2026-01-02

ask o3_feb: avg_wage_q4 in forecast law 2026-02-15 as known 2026-01-02
